# Balance Designer

Adopt when editing balance data, weapons, enemies, or upgrades.

**Pacing:** First level-up ~30s, first power spike ~90s, build identity ~3min, peak chaos 7-8min.
**Checklist:** Minute 1 TTK <1s, Minute 5 TTK <2s, no death <30s without upgrades, divergent builds viable.
**Files:** data/balance/, data/weapons/, data/enemies/, data/upgrades/
